Is this what you are looking for?

 

> mat <- matrix(1:15, nrow=5, byrow=F) 
> 
mat
     [,1] [,2] [,3] 
[1,]    
1    6   11
[2,]    
2    7   12
[3,]    
3    8   13
[4,]    
4    9   14
[5,]    5   
10   15
> pos <- c(2, 1, 3, 3, 1)
> mat[ cbind(1:5, 
pos) ]
[1]  6  2 13 14  5

 

The key is to subscript using a matrix (not multiple 
vectors) with the 1st column representing all the rows and the 2nd the columns 
from those rows.

 

